WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.030
Welcome.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:07.450
Here is how today's exercise works, and
what we ask of you.

3
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.230
First, the most important thing.

4
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:16.390
This exercise tests the plan, not
individuals.

5
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:21.550
Findings are reported at team level, and
the report names no one.

6
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.879
Each inject — a message, a phone call, an
alert —

7
00:00:25.879 --> 00:00:29.120
appears on the room screen and on your
phone,

8
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:33.390
with a countdown at the top that turns
amber in the last minute.

9
00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.556
Most injects need one answer per
department:

10
00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:40.310
agree it together; one person types.

11
00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:46.860
If that phone is busy or gone, press "Take
over" — the text so far comes with you.

12
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:51.730
Some injects ask everyone to answer alone;
the screen says so.

13
00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.730
Press "Submit answer" before the time
ends.

14
00:00:56.850 --> 00:01:03.640
Until then, "Edit answer" lets you change
it — then press "Submit changes".

15
00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.500
Need more time?

16
00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:11.080
In Messages, send "We need a few more
minutes".

17
00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.970
Extra time, when given, is for everyone.

18
00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:19.990
Facilitator messages appear at the top:
Reply, or Got it.

19
00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:24.846
Keep the exercise page open, your phone on
Do Not Disturb —

20
00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:27.870
not flight mode — and plugged in if you
can.

21
00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:31.760
If the page closes, open the join link
again.

22
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.820
At the end, a one-minute survey.

23
00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.840
Please answer it before you leave.

24
00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.020
That's all.

25
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:45.790
Your facilitator will start the exercise
shortly.

